<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://unpkg.com/boxicons@2.1.4/css/boxicons.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #4f46e5;
      --primary-hover: #4338ca;
      --accent: #ec4899;
      --bg-dark: #0f172a;
      --bg-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e1b4b 100%);
      --text-main: #f8fafc;
      --text-muted: #94a3b8;
      --glass-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg-gradient);
      color: var(--text-main);
      overflow-x: hidden;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    /* Abstract shapes in the background */
    .bg-shape-1 {
      position: absolute; width: 600px; height: 600px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.2) 0%, transparent 70%);
      top: -200px; right: -200px; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none;
    }
    .bg-shape-2 {
      position: absolute; width: 800px; height: 800px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
      bottom: -300px; left: -200px; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none;
    }

    /* Navbar */
    header {
      padding: 1.5rem 5%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    }

    .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      background: linear-gradient(to left, #818cf8, #e879f9);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .nav-btn {
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      color: white;
      padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 99px;
      font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: 0.3s;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .nav-btn:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); transform: translateY(-2px); }

    .nav-btn-primary {
      background: var(--primary);
      border-color: var(--primary);
    }
    .nav-btn-primary:hover { background: var(--primary-hover); }

    /* Hero Section */
    .hero {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      padding: 0 5%;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .hero-badge {
      background: rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.1);
      color: #f472b6;
      border: 1px solid rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.3);
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 99px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 4rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      max-width: 900px;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ffffff, #a5b4fc);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
    }
    
    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 700px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .hero-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .hero-btn {
      padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      border-radius: 12px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: 0.3s;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .btn-login {
      background: linear-gradient(to left, var(--primary), #8b5cf6);
      color: white;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.4);
    }
    .btn-login:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.6); }

    .btn-outline {
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      color: white;
    }
    .btn-outline:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); }

    /* Features Grid under Hero */
    .features {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 2rem;
      margin-top: 5rem;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .feature-card {
      background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 16px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 15px;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }
    .feature-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); }

    .feature-icon {
      width: 45px; height: 45px;
      background: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.2);
      color: #818cf8;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 12px; font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .feature-text h4 { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
    .feature-text p { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 4px; }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
      .hero p { font-size: 1rem; }
      .hero-buttons { flex-direction: column; width: 100%; max-width: 300px; }
      .hero-btn { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Abstract Background Elements -->
  <div class="bg-shape-1"></div>
  <div class="bg-shape-2"></div>

  <!-- Navbar -->
  <header>
    <a href="/" class="logo">
      <i class='bx bxs-graduation'></i> <span>EduSaaS</span>
    </a>
  </header>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-badge">🚀 النظام التقني الأحدث للإدارة التعليمية</div>
    <h1>أدر مركزك التعليمي باحترافية وذكاء غير مسبوق.</h1>
    <p>منصة سحابية متكاملة تتيح لك إدارة فروعك، تسجيل طلابك، متابعة المدفوعات، وإصدار تقارير دقيقة بضغطة زر واحدة. بوابتك لتحويل السنتر الخاص بك إلى كيان رقمي متطور.</p>
    
    <div class="hero-buttons">
      <a href="/student/login" class="hero-btn btn-login" style="background: linear-gradient(to left, #10b981, #059669);">
        بوابة الطالب <i class='bx bx-user'></i>
      </a>
      <a href="/center/login" class="hero-btn btn-login" style="background: linear-gradient(to left, #3b82f6, #2563eb);">
        دخول السنتر <i class='bx bxs-buildings'></i>
      </a>
      <a href="/superadmin/login" class="hero-btn btn-outline" style="border-color: #ec4899; color: #ec4899;">
        دخول الإدارة العامة <i class='bx bx-shield-quarter'></i>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Quick Features -->
  <section class="features" id="features">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon"><i class='bx bx-layer'></i></div>
      <div class="feature-text">
        <h4>متعدد الفروع (SaaS)</h4>
        <p>إدارة مراكز مستقلة تماماً ببياناتها.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon" style="background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2); color: #34d399;"><i class='bx bx-user-check'></i></div>
      <div class="feature-text">
        <h4>بوابة موحدة</h4>
        <p>رابط واحد لدخول كافة المدراء والمسؤولين.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon" style="background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2); color: #fbbf24;"><i class='bx bx-data'></i></div>
      <div class="feature-text">
        <h4>سرعة وأمان</h4>
        <p>قواعد بيانات معزولة وحماية مشفرة.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


</body>
</html>
